# held/props/pipes: the pan pipes for the Flute posture's Pipes variant: a row of reed tubes of falling length bound with cord (PROPS, P2b). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. At the mouth (pose arms: mouth), anchored on
# the right shoulder; before the face on the beard layer facing down, behind the far hand facing left, hidden from behind.
